    "updated_at": "2016-01-16T14:01:44Z",
    "body": "Per https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#es-handling-exceptions this is the default behaviour anyway.\n\nIt would probably be better to add an algorithm to WebIDL that calls this out; we're creating an IDL `Uint8ClampedArray` value rather than an ES value anyway.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
