    "body": "@domenic: To follow-up on your first comment: I was not intentionally excluding structured clone. That was an oversight on my part, which raises the question: what should we do in that case? From an implementation quality (i.e. stability) standpoint, postMessage is the only use of ImageBitmap structured clones that I really care about. It is used for image processing in workers.\n",
