    "created_at": "2016-02-29T14:48:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-29T14:48:05Z",
    "body": "I looked into making the changes to structured clone. For ImageData, the internal cloning algorithm calls itself recursively to handle the data attribute.  So, we'd need to change the definition of structured clone for ArrayBuffers to specify that an error allocating the output ArrayBuffer results in a rethrow.  This has implications that extend beyond the scope of ImageData.  Do we want to do that?\n",
